+# Bare column headers whose keys post only specialty rows. `Height` gave
+# 15286-8, left kidney height by ultrasound, so `Height 170 cm` was filed as
+# a kidney dimension; `Systolic` gave 24372-5, a peak pressure during a
+# septal defect. `Diastolic` resolved to nothing.
+Height	Body height
+Systolic	Systolic blood pressure
